id=thor-sdcard-fsck
name=Thor SD - stock exfatprogs for vold mount check
version=v2.0
versionCode=2
author=local
description=LineageOS ships exfatprogs 1.4.3, which needs 58s to check this 461GB exFAT card (158k entries). vold SIGTERMs fsck.exfat at 45s, so the card was permanently UNMOUNTABLE. AYN stock shipped exfatprogs 1.1.1, which checks the same card in 17s - comfortably inside the budget. This module restores that binary, extracted from Thor_V1.0.0.293 stock OTA. A full genuine filesystem check runs on every mount, exactly as on stock.
